  "numberOfVerses": 8,
  "chapter": {
    "number": 3,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Deliver Me, O LORD!"
      },
      {
        "type": "hebrew_subtitle",
        "text": "A Psalm of David, when he fled from his son Absalom.",
        "footnotes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "line_break"
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "text": "O LORD, how my foes have increased!\nHow many rise up against me!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 35,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 64,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "text": "Many say of me,\n“God will not deliver him.”Selah",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "noteId": 5,
            "offset": 48,
            "text": "Selah or Interlude is probably a musical or literary term; here and throughout the Psalms.",
            "caller": "+"
          }
        ],
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 15,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 43,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "text": "But You, O LORD, are a shield around me,\nmy glory, and the One who lifts my head.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 40,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 81,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "text": "I will not fear the myriads\nset against me on every side.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 27,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 57,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "line_break"
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "text": "Arise, O LORD!\nSave me, O my God!\nStrike all my enemies on the jaw;\nbreak the teeth of the wicked.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 14,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 33,
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 67,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 68,
            "end": 98,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": []
  }
}
